[260.27788, "o", " questions, write, create images, complete work, and code—all in one place. Get started for free or download the app.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 05:48:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>ChatGPT</title><link>https://chatgpt.com/features</link><description>Use ChatGPT to answer questions, write, create images, complete work, and code—all in one place. Get started for free or download the app.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:06:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Introducing ChatGPT - OpenAI</title><link>https://openai.com/index/chatgpt/</link><description>We’ve trained a model called ChatGPT which interacts in a conversational way. The dialogue format makes it possible for ChatGPT to answer followup questions, admit its mistakes, challenge incorrect premises, and reject inappropriate requests.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 01:59:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>OpenAI | Research &amp; Deployment</title><link>https://openai.com/</link><description>We believe our research "]
[260.278047, "o", "will eventually lead to artificial general intelligence, a system that can solve human-level problems.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 00:40:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>ChatGPT - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ChatGPT</link><description>ChatGPT is a generative AI chatbot developed by OpenAI. Originally released on November 30, 2022, the product uses large language models —specifically generative pre-trained transformers (GPTs)—to generate text, speech, and images in response to user prompts.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 02:21:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Get started | ChatGPT</title><link>https://chatgpt.com/auth/login</link><description>Log in or sign up to ChatGPT</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:28:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>ChatGPT</title><link>https://chatgpt.com/es-ES/</link><description>Usa ChatGPT para responder preguntas, escribir, crear imágenes, completar tareas y programar, todo en un solo lugar. Empieza gratis o descarga"]
[260.27807, "o", " la aplicación.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:56:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>ChatGPT Plan | Free</title><link>https://chatgpt.com/plans/free/</link><description>Chat with your files and images Upload a document or image, then ask questions about it. ChatGPT can read, summarize, or explain what it sees.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 21:04:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>ChatGPT</title><link>https://chatgpt.com/auth/?locale=pt-BR</link><description>Use o ChatGPT para responder a perguntas, escrever, criar imagens, realizar tarefas e programar — tudo em um só lugar. Comece gratuitamente ou baixe o aplicativo.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:13:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>ChatGPT</title><link>https://chatgpt.com/id-ID/</link><description>Gunakan ChatGPT untuk menjawab pertanyaan, menulis, membuat gambar, menyelesaikan pekerjaan, dan menulis kode—semuanya di satu tempat. Mulai gratis atau unduh aplikasinya.</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:35:00 GMT"]
